
# Experiment 3 — Kubernetes Deployment

## Objective
Deploy the HEATWATCH AI Streamlit dashboard on a Kubernetes cluster.

## Container Image
atharvbadhe01/heatwave-intelligence:1.0

## Deployment Configuration
- Deployment: heatwave-deployment
- Desired replicas: 2
- CPU request per pod: 100m
- CPU limit per pod: 500m
- Memory request per pod: 128Mi
- Memory limit per pod: 512Mi

## Service
- Name: heatwave-service
- Type: NodePort
- Service port: 8501
- NodePort: 30081

## Verified Results
- Kubernetes node status: Ready
- Deployment replicas: 2/2 available
- Both Heatwave pods: 1/1 Running
- Pod restarts: 0
- Dashboard accessed successfully using port forwarding at localhost:8503

## Evidence

- Kubernetes Deployment Starting.png
- Kubernetes Pods Running.png
- Kubernetes Dashboard.png
- Kubernetes Status.png

## Note
Direct browser access through localhost:30081 returned
a connection-refused error. Port forwarding to localhost:8503
was verified as a working access method.
